{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/binghatti-corner-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":698,"crm_id":"167","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Binghatti Corner","slug":"binghatti-corner-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2024","developer":"Binghatti","price":850000,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.0639926,"longitude":55.1988524,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Binghatti Corner is a chic project by renowned developer Binghatti Developers, with 634 luxury residences, commercial and office spaces in one of Dubai's best neighborhoods <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/jumeirah-village-circle/\">Jumeirah Village Circle</a>. The residential development with 1 basement, 4 podium and 29 residential floors will feature 1 and 2-bedroom designer apartments and luxury penthouses, as well as 69 office spaces and 14 retail spaces.</p><p>The project offers a variety of apartment types, providing a comfortable living space for every resident. The interiors of each residence are carefully planned and equipped with modern sanitary ware, furniture and fittings.</p><p>Each apartment is equipped with a private balcony offering a gorgeous view of JVC Parks. Penthouse owners will be able to appreciate the private pool from the comfort of their apartment.</p><p>Residents have access to the communal pool, gyms, yoga and meditation areas, organized recreation areas, parks and gardens. A high level of security is guaranteed by security guards and video surveillance systems, and there are parking lots for residents and guests.</p><p>Binghatti Corner residential complex is located in the Jumeirah Village Circle neighborhood. In the immediate vicinity there are all necessary infrastructure facilities: shopping centers and supermarkets, educational and medical institutions, cultural and entertainment facilities. There are also many bus stops in the neighborhood of the complex.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/167/images/2023/07/12/lZBB2uwbOSdTB5rBA68M2Japl3NxcrcjTEPtb3k2.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/07/12/lZBB2uwbOSdTB5rBA68M2Japl3NxcrcjTEPtb3k2.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/167/images/2023/07/12/kmtkBx8zfXXMRtFguvDyGK1v6srjfhPBHjdcGQY0.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/07/12/kmtkBx8zfXXMRtFguvDyGK1v6srjfhPBHjdcGQY0.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/167/images/2023/07/12/Fng9IKAAH2vqBJdLT8odxokluhV9sjpSbcjAN0PN.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/07/12/Fng9IKAAH2vqBJdLT8odxokluhV9sjpSbcjAN0PN.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":1602,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/binghatti_corner_brochure_83ae589378.pdf","hash":"binghatti_corner_brochure_83ae589378","name":"Binghatti Corner Brochure PDF"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":871,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"","payment_plans":[],"community":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":7068,"url":null,"text":"Covered Parking","type":null,"image":null},{"id":7069,"url":null,"text":"Security and CCTV","type":null,"image":null},{"id":7070,"url":null,"text":"Laundry","type":null,"image":null},{"id":7071,"url":null,"text":"Accessibility f